# This file allows us to add out of band annotations of the auto-generated plptools Swift APIs. Right now, it exists
# solely to ensure the RFSV and RPCS classes remain available to the Swift API even though they are not copyable or
# movable. We achieve this by the dangerous act of making them immortal references. This means they should _never_ be
# used directly as references are guaranteed to leak. Fortunately Reconnect only uses `RFSVClient` and `RPCSClient`
# which manage instances internally.
---
Name: core
Tags:
- Name: RFSV
  SwiftImportAs: reference
  SwiftRetainOp: immortal
  SwiftReleaseOp: immortal
- Name: RPCS
  SwiftImportAs: reference
  SwiftRetainOp: immortal
  SwiftReleaseOp: immortal
